{"3922160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DryFire", "steam_appid": 3922160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DryFire is a tactical FPS built on the fundamentals of mechanical skill and map control.  Built by those who grew up with Call of Duty:4 and Battlefield 3.  DryFire offers a modern approach to the basics.  And fun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Loop:</strong> Focused 5v5 defusal gameplay designed for tight, competitive encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanical Integrity:</strong> Weapon behavior prioritizes precision and consistent recoil patterns over automated systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Pay-to-Win:</strong> The game features zero loot boxes or microtransactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map Design:</strong> Levels are built with a focus on sightlines and tactical flow, while remaining artistic and unique.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a developer-led project built for players who want a straightforward, high-stakes shooter experience. Expect regular updates and a commitment to the core gameplay loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DryFire is a tactical FPS built on the fundamentals of mechanical skill and map control.  Built by those who grew up with Call of Duty:4 and Battlefield 3.  DryFire offers a modern approach to the basics.  And fun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Loop:</strong> Focused 5v5 defusal gameplay designed for tight, competitive encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mechanical Integrity:</strong> Weapon behavior prioritizes precision and consistent recoil patterns over automated systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Pay-to-Win:</strong> Th